title UC-T03 - Update Charging-Point Status
|External Telemetry System (Actor)|
|System|
|Database|
|External Telemetry System (Actor)|
start
:Send point/Hub, eventRef, observedAt, condition;\nsession/vehicle and measurements when required;
|System|
:Receive event envelope, source credentials\nand claimed scope;
|Database|
:Retrieve source permissions, resource mappings and\nvalidation policy;
|System|
if () then ([data unavailable])
:Return retryable failure; preserve accepted state;\ndo not infer availability;
stop
else ([data available])
endif
:Authenticate machine identity; authorize resource\nand operational/run scope;
if () then ([unauthorized source or scope])
|Database|
:Record access failure without protected details;
|System|
:Return access denied even if audit logging fails; no\noperational update;
stop
else ([authorized])
endif
:Select authorized operational context or isolated\nWhat-if run context; all following reads/writes\nstay in that scope;
:Validate point/Hub mapping, event type, timestamp,\nsupported state and required\nsession/vehicle/progress/stop references;
if () then ([invalid fields / mapping / timestamp])
:Return validation reason; retain last accepted state\nand freshness;
stop
else ([valid structure])
endif
|Database|
:Read original event result/fingerprint and latest\naccepted observation for resource/reporting scope\nand applicable session;
|System|
if () then ([data unavailable])
:Return retryable failure; preserve accepted state;\ndo not infer availability;
stop
else ([data available])
endif
if () then ([identical processed event])
:Return original result; no repeated effect or\nrefreshed observation time;
stop
else ([not identical processed event])
endif
if () then ([identity conflict / stale / out of order])
|Database|
:Retain conflicting evidence where applicable; leave\naccepted observation unchanged;
|System|
:Return rejection; do not advance freshness;
stop
else ([new and eligible event])
endif
repeat
|Database|
:Load current point restrictions, Hub state,\nschedule, session/request, vehicle and private-EV\nparking context and versions in selected scope;
|System|
if () then ([data unavailable])
:Return retryable failure; preserve accepted state;\ndo not infer availability;
stop
else ([data available])
endif
:Match session, point and vehicle; check transition\nand allocation; start requires operational Hub/point\nand valid allocation; private EV requires Active\nparking + Checked In reservation;
if () then ([session mismatch or incompatible transition])
:Plan unresolved evidence and Operator review;\nunexpected start blocks new allocations pending\nverification; no fabricated session or free point;
else ([compatible report])
  if () then ([start / progress])
:Plan Active on confirmed start with actual start\ntime; update progress on existing session without\nrestarting;
  else ([other event])
    if () then ([confirmed stop / completion / permitted pause])
:Plan Completed if target met, Interrupted for final\nearly stop, or Paused if permitted; retain actual\nstop time; release only capacity no longer committed;
    else ([condition-only report])
:Preserve unresolved restrictions and future\nallocations;
    endif
  endif
endif
if () then ([validated point fault])
:Plan point restriction and equivalent incident\nupdate; identify affected allocations; without\nconfirmed cessation keep last confirmed session\nstate and require verification;
else ([no fault])
endif
|Database|
:Guarded atomic commit: recheck identity, ordering,\npermissions and context versions; save accepted\nobservation, actual time, state effects, evidence\nand original result together; unresolved transition\nsaves evidence/restriction only; eligible capacity\nrelease creates one scoped scheduling work item;
|System|
if () then ([concurrent state changed])
:Preserve current commitments; reload and re-evaluate\nonly while retry policy permits;
else ([no concurrency conflict])
endif
repeat while () is ([conflict and retry permitted]) not ([terminal outcome / retry exhausted])
if () then ([conflict remains / definite save failure])
:Return retryable failure; no partial effects or\nnewly available capacity;
stop
else ([other result])
endif
if () then ([outcome unknown])
|Database|
:Retrieve original processing result using same\nsource, scope and eventRef;
|System|
else ([outcome known])
endif
if () then ([outcome still unknown])
:Return unconfirmed outcome; resolve original result\nbefore retrying; never acknowledge as applied;
stop
else ([outcome resolved])
endif
if () then ([resolved result is a definite failure])
:Return original failure; no partial update;\nreload and revalidate before retry;
stop
else ([committed or rejected result])
endif
if () then ([final identity/order check rejected event])
:Return stale/conflicting rejection; preserve\naccepted state and freshness;
stop
else ([committed / original result recovered])
endif
:Expose committed observation time, freshness,\nrestrictions and discrepancies in monitoring/detail\nviews;
if () then ([eligible release with pending scheduling work])
:Signal scoped queue re-evaluation using original\neventRef; scheduler handles work once; retain work\nfor retry if notification fails;
else ([no scheduling work])
endif
:Send processing result and event reference;\nunresolved evidence is not an accepted session\ntransition;
if () then ([acknowledgement lost])
|External Telemetry System (Actor)|
:Retry with SAME event reference, payload and scope;\nnext attempt retrieves original result;
else ([acknowledgement received])
|External Telemetry System (Actor)|
:Receive processing result;
endif
stop
